    "body": "Answers:\n\n- Command: `uv run python -m tally finance.csv --column amount`\n- The export has currency-formatted amounts, e.g. `$1,234.56` and `$12.00`. Sample:\n  ```\n  vendor,amount\n  Acme,\"$1,234.56\"\n  Bolt,$12.00\n  Crane,\n  ```\n- Finance's total for that file: 1246.56.\n- tally now exits 1 with `tally: value '$1,234.56' in column 'amount' on row 2 is not a number` (before the streaming change it printed a traceback). Either way, no total.\n\nWe can't change the export format. Expected: `1246.56`.",
