    "body": "**factory · implement → implemented** · claude-sonnet-5 · $0.66 · 2m · [run](https://github.com/tianchi-fetch/factory-sandbox/actions/runs/34764219577)\nFixed tally to strip `$` and thousands `,` before parsing amounts, so currency-formatted finance exports sum correctly (reproduced the reporter's file: now prints 1246.56). Validated with `uv run pytest -q` (38 passed) plus a manual CLI repro; PR: https://github.com/tianchi-fetch/factory-sandbox/pull/13\n\nOnly the summed value is cleaned — the non-numeric-cell error message still shows the original cell text, and the group key (relevant when --group-by names the same column as --column) still uses the raw, unmodified text, preserving that invariant from issue #4's spec work. Did not add support for parenthesized negatives or non-USD symbols since the triage comment explicitly scoped those out as unevidenced.\n\nOne environment note unrelated to the fix: the worktree's branch base was stale relative to origin/main (which had since updated .github/workflows/factory.yml), causing an initial push rejection from the GitHub App's workflow-permission guard. Rebased onto origin/main before pushing, which resolved it — no code changes involved.\n<!-- factory:run {\"verdict\":\"implemented\",\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"station\":\"implement\",\"turns\":34,\"run_url\":\"https://github.com/tianchi-fetch/factory-sandbox/actions/runs/34764219577\",\"duration_ms\":131931,\"session_id\":\"08104734-4e28-4127-b520-fad3ac38e700\",\"head\":null,\"ts\":\"2026-09-13T15:01:36Z\",\"cost_usd\":0.6609} -->",
