    "body": "**factory · review → request_changes** · claude-opus-5 · $0.80 · 3m · [run](https://github.com/tianchi-fetch/factory-sandbox/actions/runs/34764367988)\nThe reporter's case is fixed and verified (1246.56, exit 0), but stripping every comma means `1.234,56` now sums to `1.23` at exit 0 instead of failing loudly — a silently wrong total, the same failure class as the issue. One important finding with a validated fix.\n<!-- factory:run {\"verdict\":\"request_changes\",\"turns\":12,\"session_id\":\"2d7ff8e7-e7b5-4900-9cc4-d72f9a8850a8\",\"station\":\"review\",\"duration_ms\":153681,\"head\":\"faf132cea76b53c02019e074afad3bfb78ea8089\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"ts\":\"2026-09-13T15:04:53Z\",\"cost_usd\":0.8044,\"run_url\":\"https://github.com/tianchi-fetch/factory-sandbox/actions/runs/34764367988\"} -->",
